weston (13.0.1-1qti1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Weston 13.0.1 with Qualcomm SDM backend support
  * Add TP10_UBWC pixel format support
  * Add GBM buffer backend interface
  * Add protected content rendering support
  * Refine overlay view drawing logic
  * Change default repaint window to 15ms
  * Add atrace markers for debugging
  * Port UMD-specific changes from weston-10
  * Make YUV format use EXTERNAL_OES texture
  * Enable ASAN and fix ODR violation errors
  * Disable partial update

